    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Starships_of_the_Galaxy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Starships of the Galaxy</a></i></p><p><b>Emplacement Points:</b>&nbsp;1</p><p>Toward the end of the Clone Wars, many ships were outfitted with specialized jamming equipment keyed to affect droid sensors and avionics. When the Droid Jammers are employed, attacks from the Starship gain a +2 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus to hit automated craft, such as the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/%22Vulture%22_Droid_Starfighter\" title=\"&quot;Vulture&quot; Droid Starfighter\">\"Vulture\" Droid Starfighters</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid_Tri-Fighter\" title=\"Droid Tri-Fighter\">Droid Tri-Fighters</a> employed by the Trade Federation. The Droid Jammers affect only <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Droid\">Droid</a>-controlled spacecraft within a 5-square radius.</p>",
